OL,3,GNEWSAYoung red squirrel arrives at
OL,4,Aconservation site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young female red squirrel has arrived
OL,7,Fat a conservation site where it is
OL,8,Fhoped she will breed.
OL,10,FCinnamon, who was released on Monday,
OL,11,Fjoined a two-year-old male named David
OL,12,FAttenborough at Castle Howard Arboretum
OL,13,Fin North Yorkshire.
OL,15,FShe was welcomed as part of its red
OL,16,Fsquirrel breeding programme, which aims
OL,17,Fto boost the population of the
OL,18,Fendangered native species.
OL,20,FSince the initiative started in 2023,
OL,21,F15 baby squirrels, known as kits, have
OL,22,Fbeen born at the site.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
